{
  "bodyHash": "+5l9MCs81Cc=",
  "content": "<ul>\n<li><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">&nbsp;適用於 FORGE 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">NEOFORGE 1.21.1</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>必要模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Integrated API</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Create</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Quark</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Supplementaries</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>可選整合模組：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes O’ Plenty</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Alex’s Mobs</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Guard Villagers</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Artifacts</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Biomes You'll Go</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Regions Unexplored</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Terralith</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Waystones</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Farmer's Delight</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ice and Fire</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Ars Nouveau</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Archeology</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">_________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g47qxf6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\"><strong><strong>什麼是整合地城與結構？</strong></strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 整合地城與結構（IDAS）是一個模組，它使用 Quark、Alex's Mobs 和 Create 的方塊與生物，添加了極具細節的結構，並可選整合許多其他模組。我厭倦了在模組包中安裝結構模組後，探索世界卻只找到原版物品，且毫無難度可言。我熱愛精緻的建築和 Create 的機械，因此決定製作一個能填補這份遺憾的模組。充滿故事性、美麗且充滿挑戰的地城與結構，完美整合多個核心 Forge 模組。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果你是第一次接觸這個模組，我強烈建議你尋找迷宮、工匠工坊、古老礦坑或掠奪者堡壘，並親自體驗一番。這些建築耗費了我最長的時間來建造，我認為它們真的非常有趣且值得探索。祝你好運！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>看看我的其他作品！</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft</a>，整合結構系列的官方模組包</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Stronghold</a><br></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong><a style=\"color:#800080\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Villages</a></strong></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>設定與可選整合：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於 1.16</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">編輯設定檔<br>IDAS 會自動偵測是否安裝 Ice and Fire，並相應調整部分結構的戰利品和生物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>適用於 1.18 及以上版本</strong><br>若要啟用 BOP 整合，請下載此<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-bop\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\">資料包</span></span></a>。<br>若要啟用 Alex's Mobs 整合，請下載此<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要進行其他設定，請下載此<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/idas-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">資料包</a></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要調整生成率，請更改結構集中的 spacing（間距）和 separation（間隔）。Spacing 是兩次相鄰生成嘗試之間的平均距離。數值範圍為 0 到 4096。<br>Separation 是兩個相鄰嘗試間的最小區塊距離。數值範圍為 0 到 4096，且不能大於 spacing。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要編輯生態域，請編輯 tags/worldgen/biome/has structure 中的生態域檔案</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要停用結構，請移除其標籤列表中的所有生態域，或將 separation 和 spacing 設為極高的數值</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要提高與其他結構模組的相容性，請將結構添加到每個 worldgen/configured_structure_feature 檔案中的「要避免的結構集」列表中</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>注意：</strong>使用全域資料包模組時，如果你同時使用 BOP 和設定資料包，必須手動確保 BOP 整合資料包位於設定資料包之上。</span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>功能與規劃中功能：</strong></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在主世界與地獄維度中，超過 50 個獨特且極具細節的結構，包括：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 20 個獨特的小型且細節豐富的世界建築結構，例如營地、市集、動物巢穴等</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 7 個終局等級的地城，範圍從廣闊的矮人礦坑到沙漠迷宮，再到掠奪者堡壘</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 以 Create 為主題的地城，設有旋轉死亡陷阱，例如工匠工坊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 15 棟獨特的房屋與旅店，供疲憊的旅人休息</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 6 座魔法師與附魔塔可供探索</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 沉沒的海盜船</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 村民城堡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 地獄中的魔法塔與傳送門可供探索</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 事件型結構，例如冬之馬車與鬼屋</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>規劃中功能：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 地下地城變體</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 更多地獄與終界結構</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- <strong>加入我的 Discord 來提出建議，並投票決定接下來要新增哪些結構！</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><strong>如果你在尋找這些結構時遇到困難，只需在聊天欄中輸入 `/locate idas`，你應該會看到所有結構的清單。例如，輸入 `/locate idas:castle` 將會找到離你最近的城堡。</strong></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>所有結構圖片</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【強大迷宮】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/563/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"429\" height=\"241\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/569/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"321\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【掠奪者堡壘】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/517/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"378\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/518/2022-04-12_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"374\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【古代礦坑】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/716/2022-04-29_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/717/2022-05-01_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"301\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/718/2022-05-01_12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"299\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【巫師塔】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/570/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【附魔塔】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/734/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【廢棄房屋】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/565/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"548\" height=\"308\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/460/853/2022-05-10_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"549\" height=\"309\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【城堡】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/568/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"553\" height=\"415\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/864/2022-08-26_14.png\" width=\"552\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/87/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"550\" height=\"289\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【磚造房屋】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/735/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【鄉間小屋】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/736/2022-05-01_18.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【鬼屋】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/566/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"307\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/449/567/2022-04-01_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"414\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;【熊爪旅館】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/402/2022-05-19_17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/462/403/2022-05-19_16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【沉船】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/463/968/2022-05-22_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【獵人小屋】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/465/540/2022-05-29_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"321\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【農舍】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/920/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"568\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/466/922/2022-06-05_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"569\" height=\"320\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/722/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"321\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【女巫樹樁】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/155/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/156/2022-06-13_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"323\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【隱士幽谷】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/234/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/470/235/2022-06-18_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【藥劑師之家】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/720/apothecary.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/475/721/2022-07-10_11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"588\" height=\"331\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【漁夫小屋】由 Nirze 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/943/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/477/944/2022-07-18_21.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"587\" height=\"330\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【紅角公會】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/225/2022-07-23_08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>【養蜂人的房屋】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/484/677/2022-08-09_09.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>【樹頂酒館】由 Howester1984 與 chloe2cu 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/485/811/2022-08-12_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>【遠古傳送門】由 CraisinLord 與 Nirze 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/947/5959975b-dbad-419d-85d3-5287742817ab.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/948/ed56c84f-9547-45a8-ada0-5bc5b05d95e1.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>【工匠工坊】由 CraisinLord 與 Howester1984 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/950/54124500-3512-4afe-b6f0-376fb5d72bd1.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/488/951/07e24ea0-43c8-4fdd-a387-1be8f8b9361c.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>【死靈法師尖塔】由 CraisinLord 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/491/735/2022-08-29_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"328\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>【市集】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/493/279/2022-09-05_11.png\" width=\"582\" height=\"327\"><br>【鬧鬼莊園】由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/889/2022-10-20_15.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br>【冬日馬車】由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/577/890/2022-12-23_19.png\" width=\"580\" height=\"326\"><br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>【不祥恐懼堡壘】由 CraisinLord 設計（僅限冰與火模組）</strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/610/735/2023-01-21_10.png\" width=\"583\" height=\"312\"></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong><br>【連結點】由 Codex 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/641/934/2023-04-01_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\">此建築中的傳送門種類：<br></strong></strong></span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>以太</p>\n<p>暮光森林</p>\n<p>阿圖姆</p>\n<p>地獄</p>\n<p>深淵/深暗花園</p>\n<p>蜜蜂領域</p>\n<p>伊甸環</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【深海遺跡】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/507/2023-05-26_11.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"329\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/667/508/2023-05-25_21.png\" width=\"585\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【火車遺跡】由 brythonderoos 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/820/362/2024-03-07_00.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【冰凍墓穴】由 Darth Trayus 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/834/984/2024-03-12_11.png\" width=\"586\" height=\"313\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【挖掘現場】由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/364/2024-06-30_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【沙漠挖掘現場】由 Howester1984 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/363/2024-07-01_16.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>【工匠堡壘】由 Darth Trayus 設計<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/361/2024-07-01_13.png\" width=\"592\" height=\"317\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【大法師之塔】由 Cpt_Gloval 設計（需要安裝 ARS NOUVEAU 模組）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/905/362/2024-07-01_14.png\" width=\"588\" height=\"314\"><br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【廢棄燈塔】由 Ghast 設計<br></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1049/88/2024-12-24_20.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"310\"></strong></span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【收藏家博物館】由 Ghast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/982/2025-03-17_19.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【風吹的神社】由 Jawredstoneguy 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1129/983/2025-03-15_23.png\" width=\"595\" height=\"318\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【海妖灣】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/928/2026-03-20_14-55-57-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【植物學家住所】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/912/2026-03-20_14-46-06-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【圓木小屋】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/913/2026-03-20_14-48-39-png.png\" width=\"591\" height=\"316\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【廢棄葡萄園】由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/925/2026-03-20_14-53-35-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【廢棄教堂】由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/929/2026-03-20_14-50-22-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【廢棄堡壘】由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/926/2026-03-20_14-54-33-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"315\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【廢棄水井】由 Ghaast 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/927/2026-03-20_14-55-17-png.png\" width=\"593\" height=\"317\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【石匠之家】由 Qwerty 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/930/2026-03-20_14-53-04-png.png\" width=\"596\" height=\"319\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【都鐸風格酒吧】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/900/2026-03-20_14-16-24-png.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"460\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【古怪雜貨店】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1590/908/2026-03-20_14-17-45-png.png\" width=\"546\" height=\"409\"></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>【南瓜咖啡廳】由 Howester1984 設計</strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1729/873/2026-06-11_10-53-24-png.png\" width=\"433\" height=\"353\"></strong></span></div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>常見問題解答：</strong></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：哪些生態域模組相容？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：大部分生態域模組都相容，包括 Terralith、BOP 和 BYG。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：為什麼有這麼多依賴項？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：是的。</span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：你會回溯版本或更新到 ___ 嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：我會隨著依賴項更新，始終讓模組保持與最新版本的 Minecraft 相容。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：這個模組能與其他建築模組一起運作嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：可以，所有 Yung 的模組、Repurposed Structures 等都能完美相容，沒有任何問題。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：我可以在模組包中使用這個模組嗎？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：當然可以！我非常樂見這個模組被用在模組包中。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：這個模組可以只安裝在伺服器端嗎？<br>答：不行，因為它包含自訂音樂唱片、原聲帶，以及對客戶端結構方塊的修改。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：給所有想住在建築裡的玩家：如何讓生物停止生成？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：試試使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magnum Torch Mod</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問：Quark 的哪些功能可以停用？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">答：所有技術性變更和紅石相關功能都可以安全停用，但 IDAS 會用到所有建築方塊。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">這裡是 KaupenJoe 製作的一段 </strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>非常</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">精彩的 IDAS 影片模組展示：</strong></strong><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5DU4DlTWQiw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"428\" height=\"428\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraisincraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/988/bh_id_promo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"160\"></span></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">我花了超過 300 小時來建造和編寫這個模組。我是為此專門學習 Java 的。如果你非常喜歡我的作品，有兩個很好的方法可以支持我：直接透過 Patreon 贊助，或透過 Bisect Hosting 購買你的伺服器。點擊上方圖片獲取伺服器，使用我的代碼 CraisinCraft 即可享受首月 25% 折扣，並與朋友們一起暢玩！設定非常簡單，基本上只需一鍵操作。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:14px\">點擊下方圖片前往我的 Patreon 直接支持我。你將獲得專屬的 Discord 身分組、聊天頻道，並能直接影響 IDAS 的開發方向。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/craisinlord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#800080\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/148/digital-patreon-wordmark_fierycoral.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"88\"></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">特別感謝：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的 Patreon 贊助者們！！！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Howester1984、Nirze，以及 IDAS 建築團隊，他們為這個模組建造了許多美麗的建築！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Cama，創作了模組中那些令人驚嘆的音樂唱片</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fnighthearted%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nighthearted</a>，我參考了他們城堡建築的原始形狀，並用在掠奪者堡壘中。不過方塊配色、內部裝飾和所有細節都是我自己的創作。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">Bisect Hosting 團隊，特別是 Perz 為這個模組製作了 Logo！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">TelepathicGrunt，Repurposed Structures 的作者。我大量參考了他們模組的檔案作為編碼參考。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">YUNGNICKYOUNG 提供的結構模板管理器。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px;color:#800080\">我的貓 Fonzy，在我編寫整個模組期間一直坐在我腿上。腿上有重量真的能幫助你保持專注。</span></p><p>&nbsp;undefined</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">如果遇到任何問題或有任何建議，請點擊下方圖片或連結加入 Discord，我會盡力回覆所有人，並且非常歡迎你的建議！感謝你遊玩和支持我的模組！</span>&nbsp;undefined</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight:400;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f72a7jmc5mb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
